 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Past unreal conditional",
     "texto": [
      "It's formed with **hätte** or **wäre** and the participle at the end: **Wenn ich mehr geschlafen hätte, wäre ich nicht krank geworden** (if I had slept more, I wouldn't have got ill). The auxiliary usually matches the Perfekt: many intransitive verbs of change of place or state use **wäre** (**gegangen**, **geworden**); many others use **hätte** (**gewusst**, **geschlafen**)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Without wenn",
     "texto": [
      "You can drop «wenn» and change the order: **Hätte ich das gewusst, hätte ich anders gehandelt** (had I known, I would have acted differently). The conjugated verb goes first. It is very typical of formal texts."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
